// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  RAPID SERIAL MOTION DETECTION - EXPERIMENT
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*


Version :   1.5.0
Date    :   21/08/2026
Author  :   Maximilian Hohmann
            mhohmann@dpz.eu
            maximilian.hohmann@stud.uni-goettingen.de
        

EXPERIMENT DESCRIPTION:

Rapid Serial Motion Detection Task with Eye tracking (EyeLink 1000; SR Research Ltd.,
Mississauga, Ontario, Canada). Subjects perform a dual-task paradigm by monitoring both (1)
the central fixation point to report any luminance change, and (2) the Random Dot Pattern 
presented besides the fixation point to report the onset of the instructed target motion 
direction. The luminance change within a session can either be less salient allowing primary 
allocation of attentional ressources at the central fixation point, or more salient allowing
more attentional ressources to 'spill over' to detect the current target motion. The session
with less attention towards the motion detection task is defined as poor attention condition
while the session with more attention towards the motion detection task is defined as full 
atttention condition respectively. The instructed target motion can either be a clockwise
rotation (CW), counter-clockwise (CCW), expansion (EXP) or contraction (CON) motion. Motion
pairs of the same cardinal axis (i.e., rotational or radial) are sampled in one session each 
with 40 trials in each attention condition. Before the actual performance of each blocks, 
subjects perform an additional training session of 20 trails for each motion of the sampled 
motion pair. Each trial continues until 80 valid motion impulses within a stream of rapid 
serial visual presentation (RSVP) are completed without fixation breaks. Each impulse is 
presented for 150 ms followed by a blank screen for 75 ms. Before the first impulse of each 
trial, drift correction is applied followed by an static frame of the RDP for 300 ms to
indicate location of the upcoming impulse sequence. Impulse sequence appear either left or 
right to the central fixation point, changing the side for each trial to reduce any effects 
of adaptation or after images. After the last impulse within a trial a period of 1000 ms is 
given allowing responses for the last impulse direction. After each trial subjects can see 
the current trial number, and have to start this traisl by pressing both response buttons.
During the experiment subjects have to pay attention to both tasks simultaniously.

Primary Task        : Detection of luminance changes of the central fixation point. Within
                      a trial luminance changes can happen 4 to 6 times, and the average 
                      probabilityeach of luminance change onsets for each impulse is 6.25%
                      with 5 onsets on average during a trial. Luminance change is realized
                      by changing the initial RGB values (0.9) of the fixation point to the 
                      values for the poor attention condition (0.35), and full attention 
                      condition (0.05) respectively. Thus, the luminance change is less 
                      salient for the poor attention condition demanding more attentional 
                      resources. In contrast, the more salient luminance change in the full
                      attention condition allows stronger spread of attentional resources 
                      towards the motion detection task. RGB values for the training (0.20) 
                      show an intermediate saliency of luminance change for proper training.

Secondary Task      : Detection of target direction of RDP impulses. Number of shown target 
                      motions varries between 4 and 6 for each trial, with average appearance
                      of 5 times. For each session only one motion pair (either CW and CCW or 
                      EXP and CON) is assigned as possible target motion, which then alters 
                      for each block. Sequence of assigned target motion is counterbalanced 
                      across subjects, sessions, and blocks.

Eye Tracking        : We controlled for the gaze direction of subjects using eye-tracking 
                      (EyeLink 1000, SR Research Ltd., Mississauga, Ontario, Canada). Subjects
                      had to fixate the central fixation point within a radius of 1.5 dva. To 
                      ensure precise eye tracking subjects had to stablize their head position
                      using a headrest (chinrest and headband). We used blink correction which
                      tolarated any fixation breaks faster then 170 ms. We also added drift 
                      correction to ensure that small changes of head position do not affect
                      eye tracking. At the start of each trial, subjects had to fixate the 
                      central fixation point within a radius of 1.5 dva. 40 samples of the 
                      current fixation are collected at an interval of 5 ms, with an prior
                      delay of 300 ms to filter out noisy fluctuations of initial fixation 
                      data. Eye tracker data are then corrected by subtracting the averaged 
                      offset value of the sampled data. Drift correction is repeated if any 
                      fixation breaks occurred during the sampling procedure or if the average
                      offset value was larger then the radius of fixation (1.5 dva). 

                      If any fixation break longer than 170 ms occured during a trial, the 
                      sequence of impulses is still displayed but each impulse never contained
                      a motion in the currently assigned target direction nor luminance change.
                      These impulse were exlcuded from analysis by indicating them as invalid.
                      During missing fixation, a feedback sound is played and looped every 
                      500 ms until fixation was restored.
*/



// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  IO Devices
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


// ---------- Display ----------
stimulus_display 'Stimulus Display' (BG_r, BG_g, BG_b)


// ---------- Eyelink ----------
eyelink Eyelink (

    data_interval                           = 1ms
    eye_rx                                  = EYE_right_x_raw
    eye_ry                                  = EYE_right_y_raw
    eye_lx                                  = EYE_left_x_raw
    eye_ly                                  = EYE_left_y_raw 
    eye_x                                   = EYE_x_raw
    eye_y                                   = EYE_y_raw 
    href_rx                                 = EYE_href_right_x
    href_ry                                 = EYE_href_right_y
    href_lx                                 = EYE_href_left_x
    href_ly                                 = EYE_href_left_y
    pupil_rx                                = EYE_pupil_right_x
    pupil_ry                                = EYE_pupil_right_y
    pupil_lx                                = EYE_pupil_left_x
    pupil_ly                                = EYE_pupil_left_y
    pupil_size_r                            = EYE_pupil_right_size
    pupil_size_l                            = EYE_pupil_left_size
    eye_time                                = EYE_sample_time
    tracking_dist                           = 1024
    tracker_ip                              = '100.1.1.1'
)


// ---------- Eye Calibrator ----------
standard_eye_calibrator EyeCalibrator (

    eyeh_raw                                = EYE_x_raw
    eyev_raw                                = EYE_y_raw
    eyeh_calibrated                         = EYE_x_dva 
    eyev_calibrated                         = EYE_y_dva
)


// ---------- Eye Monitor ----------
basic_eye_monitor EyeMonitor (

    eyeh_calibrated                         = EYE_x_dva
    eyev_calibrated                         = EYE_y_dva
    eye_state                               = EYE_saccade
    width_samples                           = 5
    saccade_entry_speed                     = 50
    saccade_exit_speed                      = 20
)


// ---------- Blink Correction ----------
iodevice/blinkCorrection blinkCorrection (

    data_interval                           = 1ms
    fixationPoint_in                        = IO_fixation_flag 
    fixationPoint_corrected                 = IO_fixationCorrected 
    eyelink_raw_x                           = EYE_x_raw
    initial_delay                           = CTRL_BlinkInitialDelay_ms
    max_blink_duration                      = CTRL_BlinkMaxDuration_ms
    blink_counter                           = INFO_counterBlinks_num
    debug_messages                          = true
)


// ---------- Gamepad ----------
iodevice/usbhid_generic gamePad (

    preferred_location_id                   = 1
    usage_page                              = 1
    usage                                   = 4
    log_all_input_values                    = false
    autostart                               = true
) {
    // Buttons
    usbhid_generic_input_channel (usage_page = 9; usage = 4; value = IO_gpButton4)

    usbhid_generic_input_channel (usage_page = 9; usage = 5; value = IO_gpTriggerLeftUp) 
    usbhid_generic_input_channel (usage_page = 9; usage = 6; value = IO_gpTriggerRightUp) 
}



// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Variables
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


// ---------- Input ----------
group Condition {

    var EXP_note                            = "RapidSerialMotionDetection"
    var EXP_version                         = "1.5.0"
    var EXP_motion_condition                = "CW"          // CW, CCW, EXP, CON
    var EXP_attention_condition             = "train"       // train, poor, full
    var EXP_handedness                      = "R"           // R, L
    var EXP_correct_input                   = true
    var EXP_use_eye_tracking                = true          // enable eye tracking
    var EXP_debugging                       = false         // enable report

    // Info
    var INFO_correctResponse                = 0
    var INFO_incorrectResponse              = 0
    var INFO_fixationBreak                  = 0
    var INFO_counterBlinks_num		        = 0
}


// ---------- Parameters ----------
group Parameters {

    // luminance task
    var LUM_button                          = ""            // response button

    var LUM_target_total                    = 0             // number of targets per trial
    var LUM_target_remain                   = 0             // remaining targets number
    var LUM_target_counter                  = 0             // current target number
    
    var LUM_target_spacing                  = 0             // current impulse spacing between targets
    var LUM_target_spacing_init             = 2             // impulse spacing after target onset

    var LUM_assign_target                   = false         // assign target for current impulse index
    var LUM_force_target                    = false         // force target onset for current impulse index
    var LUM_planned_target                  = false         // scheduled target onset
    var LUM_target_onset                    = false         // actual target onset

    var LUM_target_idx_counter              = 0             // planned target impulse index
    var LUM_target_idx_1                    = 0
    var LUM_target_idx_2                    = 0
    var LUM_target_idx_3                    = 0
    var LUM_target_idx_4                    = 0
    var LUM_target_idx_5                    = 0
    var LUM_target_idx_6                    = 0

    var LUM_col_init                        = 0.9           // initial luminance value
    var LUM_col_change                      = 0             // current luminance value during change
    var LUM_col_train                       = 0.2           // luminance value for training session
    var LUM_col_poor                        = 0.35          // luminance value for poor attention session
    var LUM_col_full                        = 0.05          // luminance value for full attention session

    // motion task
    var MOT_button                          = ""            // response button

    var MOT_target_total                    = 0             // number of targets per trial
    var MOT_target_remain                   = 0             // remaining targets number
    var MOT_target_counter                  = 0             // current target number
    
    var MOT_target_spacing                  = 0             // current impulse spacing between targets
    var MOT_target_spacing_init             = 0             // impulse spacing after target onset

    var MOT_assign_target                   = false         // assign target for current impulse index
    var MOT_force_target                    = false         // force target onset for current impulse index 
    var MOT_planned_target                  = false         // scheduled target onset
    var MOT_target_onset                    = false         // actual target onset

    var MOT_target_idx_counter              = 0             // planned target impulse index
    var MOT_target_idx_1                    = 0
    var MOT_target_idx_2                    = 0
    var MOT_target_idx_3                    = 0
    var MOT_target_idx_4                    = 0
    var MOT_target_idx_5                    = 0
    var MOT_target_idx_6                    = 0

    var MOT_target_dir                      = 0

    // impulses
    var IMP_total_demo                      = 30            // number of impulses for target demo 
    var IMP_counter_demo                    = 0 

    var IMP_total                           = 80            // number of impulses per trial
    var IMP_remain                          = 0             // remaining impulse number
    var IMP_counter_valid                   = 0             // current number of valid impulses
    var IMP_counter_all                     = 0             // current number of all impulses
    
    var IMP_valid_onset                     = false
    var IMP_onset                           = false

    var IMP_idx                             = 0             // impulse index for preallocation

    var IMP_dir_interval                    = 22.5
    var IMP_dir_total                       = 360 / IMP_dir_interval
}


// ---------- Trial ----------
group TRIAL {

    var TRIAL_start                         = 0
    var TRIAL_end                           = 0
    var TRIAL_number                        = 0
    var TRIAL_total                         = 0
    var ML_sync                             = 0
}


// ---------- Gamepad ----------
group Gamepad {

    var IO_gpButton4                        = 0
    var IO_gpTriggerLeftUp                  = 0
    var IO_gpTriggerRightUp                 = 0
}


// ---------- Eye Tracking ----------
group EYE { 

    // eyelink
    var EYE_right_x_raw                     = (float)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_right_y_raw                     = (float)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_left_x_raw                      = (float)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_left_y_raw                      = (float)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_x_raw                           = (float)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_y_raw                           = (float)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_href_right_x                    = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_href_right_y                    = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_href_left_x                     = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_href_left_y                     = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_pupil_right_x                   = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_pupil_right_y                   = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_pupil_left_x                    = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_pupil_left_y                    = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_pupil_right_size                = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_pupil_left_size                 = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var EYE_sample_time                     = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    
    // drift correction
    var EYE_sample_total                    = 40            // number of sampled offsets      
    var EYE_sample_count                    = 0             // counter of sampled offsets
    var Eye_sample_time_ms                  = 5             // time interval for sampling gaze position
    var EYE_sample_x_dva                    = 0             // sampled x position of gaze 
    var EYE_sample_y_dva                    = 0             // sampled y position of gaze 
    var EYE_sample_x_offset                 = 0             // averaged x offsets
    var EYE_sample_y_offset                 = 0             // averaged y offsets
    var EYE_x_dva_offset                    = 0             // x offset applied to x eye values 
    var EYE_y_dva_offset                    = 0             // y offset applied to y eye values 
    var EYE_x_dva_corr                      = 0             // corrected x eye values
    var EYE_y_dva_corr                      = 0             // corrected y eye values

    // calibrator
    var EYE_x_dva                           = (float)(0)(persistant = YES) {
        EYE_x_dva_corr                      = EYE_x_dva + EYE_x_dva_offset  // variable attached updating
        }      
    var EYE_y_dva                           = (float)(0)(persistant = YES) {
        EYE_y_dva_corr                      = EYE_y_dva + EYE_y_dva_offset  // variable attached updating
        }      

    // monitor
    var EYE_saccade                         = (integer)(0)(persistant = YES)
    var IO_fixation_flag                    = false
    var IO_fixationCorrected                = false
}


// ---------- Calibration ----------
group Calibration {

    var CALIB_value                         = 0
    var CALIB_count                         = 0
    var CALIB_total                         = 12
    var CALIB_ITI_ms                        = 1000
    var CALIB_FixHold_ms                    = 1000
}


// ---------- Control ----------
group CTRL {

    // blink correction
    var CTRL_BlinkInitialDelay_ms           = 20
    var CTRL_BlinkMaxDuration_ms            = 150

    // fixation
    var CTRL_Fix_width_dva                  = 50            // default for calibration (diameter)
    var CTRL_Drift_width_dva                = 3             // width used during drift correction
    var CTRL_Drift_offset_min_dva           = 0             // lower limit for offset correction (radius)
    var CTRL_Drift_offset_max_dva           = 0             // upper limit for offset correction (radius) 
    var CTRL_Fix_width_true_dva             = 0 {           // store intial width for reset after drift correction
        CTRL_Drift_offset_min_dva           = -0.5 * CTRL_Fix_width_dva     // variable attached updating
        CTRL_Drift_offset_max_dva           = 0.5 * CTRL_Fix_width_dva      // variable attached updating    
        }            

    // states
    var CTRL_DriftAccept                    = false
    var CTRL_FixBreak_flag                  = false
    var CTRL_FixHold_flag                   = false
    var CTRL_FixSound_flag                  = true

    // formula to compute precise timing
    var CTRL_refresh_rate                   = 120                                       // frame rate in Hz
    var CTRL_frame_ms                       = 2/CTRL_refresh_rate * 1000                // two frame buffer time
    var CTRL_frame_buffer_us                = CTRL_frame_ms*1000 + CTRL_frame_ms*100    // time buffer for precise timer
    
    // timer
    var CTRL_onset_ms                       = 150           // impulse onset duration
    var CTRL_offset_ms                      = 75            // impulse offset duration

    var CTRL_ISI_ms                         = 300           // inter stimulus interval
    var CTRL_wait_ms                        = 1000          // duration after last Impulse

    var CTRL_FixSound_ms                    = 500           // delay for playing fixbreak sound
    var CTRL_FixHold_ms                     = 300           // delay for restored fixation

    // other
    var CTRL_FixSound_amp                   = 0.5                           // amplitude for fixation break sound
    var CTRL_progress                       = ''                            // text to display trial progress
    var CTRL_targets                        = IMP_total / IMP_dir_total     // expected target number per trial
}


// ---------- Color ----------
group Color {

    // background
    var BG_r                                = 0
    var BG_g                                = 0
    var BG_b                                = 0

    // text
    var TXT_r                               = 0.4
    var TXT_g                               = 0.4
    var TXT_b                               = 0.4
}


// ---------- Fixation Point ----------
group fixationPoint {

    var FixPoint_alpha                      = 1
    var FixPoint_r                          = LUM_col_init
    var FixPoint_g                          = LUM_col_init
    var FixPoint_b                          = LUM_col_init
    var FixPoint_size                       = .25
    var FixPoint_pos_x                      = 0
    var FixPoint_pos_y                      = 0
}


// ---------- Mask ----------
group MASK {

    var MASK_r                              = BG_r
    var MASK_g                              = BG_g
    var MASK_b                              = BG_b
    var MASK_alpha                          = 1
    var MASK_size                           = 0.25
    var MASK_pos_x                          = 0
    var MASK_pos_y                          = 0
}


// ---------- Random Dot Pattern ----------
group RDP {

    var RDP_space                           = "spiral"      // motion dimension (either "spiral" or "linear")
    var RDP_radius                          = 3
    var RDP_pos_x_offset                    = 3             // x offset to center

    var RDP_pos_x                           = 0 {
        MASK_pos_x                          = RDP_pos_x     // variable attached updating
        }   
    var RDP_pos_y                           = 0 {
        MASK_pos_y                          = RDP_pos_y     // variable attached updating
        }    

    var RDP_pos_z                           = 0
    var RDP_dot_num                         = 80
    var RDP_dot_size                        = 0.15
    var RDP_dot_lifetime                    = -1
    var RDP_r                               = 0.4
    var RDP_g                               = 0.4
    var RDP_b                               = 0.4
    var RDP_alpha                           = 1
    var RDP_dir                             = 0
    var RDP_dir_lifetime                    = -1
    var RDP_speed                           = 10
    var RDP_speed_true                      = RDP_speed
    var RDP_speed_lifetime                  = -1
}


// ---------- Selection ----------
group Selection {

    selection EYE_pos (
        values                              = 1:CALIB_total
        selection                           = random_without_replacement
        nsamples                            = 1
        sampling_method                     = cycles
        advance_on_accept                   = YES
        autoreset                           = YES
    )
}



// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Sounds
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

wav_file Acquire_sound (
    path                                    = './sounds/FixAcquired.wav'
    amplitude                               = 1.0
)

wav_file Fixation_sound (
    path                                    = './sounds/FixAccepted.wav'
    amplitude                               = 1.0
)

wav_file FixBreak_sound (
    path                                    = './sounds/failure.wav'
    amplitude                               = CTRL_FixSound_amp
)



// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Stimuli
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


// ---------- Blank Screen ----------
blank_screen Background (

    color                                   = BG_r, BG_g, BG_b
    )


// ---------- Fixation Point ----------
stimulus/circular_fixation_point fixationPoint (

    trigger_width                           = CTRL_Fix_width_dva
    trigger_watch_x                         = EYE_x_dva_corr
    trigger_watch_y                         = EYE_y_dva_corr
    trigger_flag                            = IO_fixation_flag
    x_size                                  = FixPoint_size
    y_size                                  = FixPoint_size
    x_position                              = FixPoint_pos_x
    y_position                              = FixPoint_pos_y
    color                                   = FixPoint_r, FixPoint_g, FixPoint_b
    rotation                                = 0
    alpha_multiplier                        = FixPoint_alpha
)


// ---------- Random Dot Pattern ----------
stimulus/d_r_d RDP (

    RDP_type                                = RDP_space
    field_radius                            = RDP_radius
    field_center_x                          = RDP_pos_x 
    field_center_y                          = RDP_pos_y
    field_center_z                          = RDP_pos_z
    num_dots                                = RDP_dot_num
    dot_size                                = RDP_dot_size
    dot_lifetime                            = RDP_dot_lifetime
    color                                   = ("$RDP_r, $RDP_g, $RDP_b")
    alpha_multiplier                        = RDP_alpha
    direction                               = RDP_dir
    direction_lifetime                      = RDP_dir_lifetime
    speed                                   = RDP_speed
    speed_lifetime                          = RDP_speed_lifetime
    reinitialize                            = 0
    version                                 = -1
)


// ---------- MASK ----------
stimulus/circle MASK(

    color                                   = MASK_r, MASK_g, MASK_b
    alpha_multiplier                        = MASK_alpha
    x_size                                  = MASK_size
    x_position                              = MASK_pos_x
    y_position                              = MASK_pos_y
)

// ---------- Start Text ----------
stimulus/text start_txt (

    text                                    = '\n\n\nPress Right and Left Trigger to See the Target Motion.'
    font_name                               = Times
    font_size                               = 30
    text_alignment                          = center
    x_size                                  = 10  
    y_size                                  = 10
    x_position                              = 0  
    y_position                              = 3  
    color                                   = TXT_r, TXT_g, TXT_b
)


// ---------- Fixation Text ----------
stimulus/text fixation_txt (

    text                                    = 'Fixation Break! \n\n\nPress Right and Left Trigger to Try Again.'
    font_name                               = Times
    font_size                               = 30
    text_alignment                          = center
    x_size                                  = 10  
    y_size                                  = 10
    x_position                              = 0  
    y_position                              = 3  
    color                                   = TXT_r, TXT_g, TXT_b
)


// ---------- Break Text ----------
stimulus/text break_txt (

    text                                    = '\n\n\nPress Right and Left Trigger to Start the next Trial.'
    font_name                               = Times
    font_size                               = 30
    text_alignment                          = center
    x_size                                  = 10  
    y_size                                  = 10
    x_position                              = 0  
    y_position                              = 3  
    color                                   = TXT_r, TXT_g, TXT_b
)


// ---------- Trial Progress Text ----------
stimulus/text progress_txt (

    text                                    = CTRL_progress     // 'x / x Trials'
    font_name                               = Times
    font_size                               = 30
    text_alignment                          = center
    x_size                                  = 10  
    y_size                                  = 10
    x_position                              = 0  
    y_position                              = 3                 // upper edge of screen
    color                                   = TXT_r, TXT_g, TXT_b
)


// ---------- Exit Text ----------
stimulus/text exit_txt (

    text                                    = '\n\n\nExperiment Completed!'
    font_name                               = Times
    font_size                               = 30
    text_alignment                          = center
    x_size                                  = 10  
    y_size                                  = 10
    x_position                              = 0  
    y_position                              = 3  
    color                                   = TXT_r, TXT_g, TXT_b
)



// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  EYE-TRACKER CALIBRATION
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


protocol 'Calibration-12P' {

    report ('=====> STARTING CALIBRATION <=====')
    report ('Fixation Width: $CTRL_Fix_width_dva')

    start_device_io (Eyelink)
    clear_calibration (EyeCalibrator)

    // reset counter
    CALIB_count                             = 0

    // reset offset vars
    EYE_x_dva_offset                        = 0
    EYE_y_dva_offset                        = 0


    trial {

        task 'Calibration Trial' {

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state CALIBRATION_HUB {

                report ('-----> TRIAL ($(CALIB_count + 1) / $CALIB_total) <-----')

                // exit 
                goto (
                    target                  = CALIBRATION_EXIT
                    when                    = CALIB_count == CALIB_total
                )

                // next trial
                goto (
                    target                  = CALIBRATION_START
                    when                    = CALIB_count < CALIB_total
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state CALIBRATION_START {

                CALIB_value                 = EYE_pos
                FixPoint_pos_x              = (((CALIB_value -1) % 4) - 1.5) * 5
                FixPoint_pos_y              = (floor((CALIB_value - 1) / 4) - 1) * 5

                
                report ('Calibration Trial: Fixation Point ($FixPoint_pos_x / $FixPoint_pos_y)')
                report ('Calibration Trial: Fixation Width = $CTRL_Fix_width_dva')

                direct (CALIBRATION_PRE_ACQUIRE)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------     
            state CALIBRATION_PRE_ACQUIRE {

                live_queue_stimulus (fixationPoint)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                goto (
                    target                  = CALIBRATION_ACQUIRE
                    when                    = IO_fixation_flag
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------      
            state CALIBRATION_ACQUIRE {

                report ('Calibration Trial: Pre Fixation Time ...')
                report ('Calibration Trial: Fixation == $IO_fixation_flag')

                start_timer (
                    timer                   = AcquireTimer
                    duration                = 250
                    duration_units          = ms
                )

                goto (
                    target                  = CALIBRATION_PRE_ACQUIRE
                    when                    = NOT(IO_fixation_flag)
                )

                timer_expired (
                    target                  = CALIBRATION_SAMPLE
                    timer                   = AcquireTimer
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------          
            state CALIBRATION_SAMPLE {

                play_sound (Acquire_sound)

                start_timer (
                    timer                   = FixationTimer
                    duration                = CALIB_FixHold_ms
                    duration_units          = ms
                )

                begin_calibration_average (EyeCalibrator)

                goto (
                    target                  = CALIBRATION_REJECTED
                    when                    = NOT(IO_fixation_flag)
                )

                timer_expired (
                    target                  = CALIBRATION_ACCEPTED
                    timer                   = FixationTimer
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------          
            state CALIBRATION_ACCEPTED {

                end_calibration_average_and_take_sample (
                    calibrator              = EyeCalibrator
                    calibratable_object     = fixationPoint
                )
                
                play_sound (Fixation_sound)

                dequeue_stimulus (fixationPoint)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                start_timer (
                    timer                   = ITI_Timer
                    duration                = CALIB_ITI_ms
                    duration_units          = ms
                )

                // update counter
                CALIB_count                 += 1

                accept_selections (EYE_pos)

                report ('Calibration Trial: Fixation Accepted!')

                goto (
                    target                  = CALIBRATION_HUB
                    when                    = timer_expired(ITI_Timer)
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------         
            state CALIBRATION_REJECTED {

                end_calibration_average_and_ignore (
                    calibrator              = EyeCalibrator
                )

                play_sound (FixBreak_sound)

                dequeue_stimulus (fixationPoint)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                start_timer (
                    timer                   = ITI_Timer
                    duration                = CALIB_ITI_ms
                    duration_units          = ms
                )

                report ('Calibration Trial: Fixation Rejected!')

                reject_selections (EYE_pos)

                goto (
                    target                  = CALIBRATION_HUB
                    when                    = timer_expired(ITI_Timer)
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------          
            state CALIBRATION_EXIT {

                update_stimulus_display ()

                update_calibration (EyeCalibrator)

                reset_selection (EYE_pos)

                report ('CALIBRATION COMPLETED!')
                report ('EXITING ...')

                wait (
                    duration                = CALIB_ITI_ms
                    duration_units          = ms
                )

                stop_device_io (Eyelink)

                yield ()
            }
        }            
    }
}



// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Experiment Task 
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

protocol 'Detection_Task' {

    report ('=====> STARTING EXPERIMENT <=====')

    // start devices
    start_device_io (gamePad)

    if_else {
        // start eye tracking if enabled
        if (EXP_use_eye_tracking == 1) {
            report ('Eye-Tracking: enabled')
            start_device_io (Eyelink)
            start_device_io (blinkCorrection)
        }
        // manually set fixation state 
        else {       
            report ('Eye-Tracking: disabled')                                
            IO_fixation_flag                = true  
            IO_fixationCorrected            = true
        }
    }

    EXP_correct_input                       = true


    // assign stimulus position
    FixPoint_pos_x                          = 0
    FixPoint_pos_y                          = 0

    // store initial fixation width
    CTRL_Fix_width_true_dva                 = CTRL_Fix_width_dva 

    // update RDP and Mask position
    RDP_pos_x                               = -1 * (RDP_pos_x_offset + RDP_radius)     // -5
    RDP_pos_y                               = 0

    // reset TRIAL vars
    TRIAL_start                             = 0
    TRIAL_end                               = 0
    TRIAL_number                            = 0
    

    trial {

        task 'Trial' {

            // ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
            state EXPERIMENT_START {
                
                live_queue_stimulus (Background)
                live_queue_stimulus (start_txt)
                live_queue_stimulus (fixationPoint)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                dequeue_stimulus (start_txt)

                // check refresh rate
                if (CTRL_refresh_rate != round(refresh_rate())) {       
                    report ('WARNING: Invalid Refresh Rate $(round(refresh_rate()))')
                    EXP_correct_input       = false
                }

                // check motion condition
                if_else {
                    // Expansion
                    if (EXP_motion_condition == "EXP") {
                        MOT_target_dir      = 0
                    }
                    // Clockwise Rotation
                    if (EXP_motion_condition == "CW") {
                        MOT_target_dir      = 90
                    }
                    // Contraction
                    if (EXP_motion_condition == "CON") {
                        MOT_target_dir      = 180
                    }
                    // Counter-Clockwise Rotation
                    if (EXP_motion_condition == "CCW") {
                        MOT_target_dir      = 270
                    }
                    // invalid input
                    else {
                        report ('WARNING: Invalid Motion Condition ($EXP_motion_condition)')
                        EXP_correct_input   = false
                    }
                }

                // check attention condition
                if_else {
                    // training
                    if (EXP_attention_condition == "train") {
                        LUM_col_change      = LUM_col_train
                        TRIAL_total         = 20
                    }
                    // poor attention
                    if (EXP_attention_condition == "poor") {
                        LUM_col_change      = LUM_col_poor
                        TRIAL_total         = 40
                    }
                    // full attention
                    if (EXP_attention_condition == "full") {
                        LUM_col_change      = LUM_col_full
                        TRIAL_total         = 40
                    }
                    // invalid input
                    else {
                        report ('WARNING: Invalid Attention Condition ($EXP_attention_condition)')
                        EXP_correct_input   = false
                    }
                }

                // check response buttons
                if_else {
                    // right handed
                    if (EXP_handedness == "R") {
                        LUM_button          = "IO_gpTriggerRightUp"
                        MOT_button          = "IO_gpTriggerLeftUp"
                    }
                    // left handed
                    if (EXP_handedness == "L") {
                        LUM_button          = "IO_gpTriggerLeftUp"
                        MOT_button          = "IO_gpTriggerRightUp"
                    }
                    // invalid input
                    else {
                        report ('WARNING: Invalid Handedness ($EXP_handedness)')
                        EXP_correct_input   = false
                    }
                }

                // report condition
                report ('Refresh Rate: $(round(refresh_rate())) Hz')
                report ('Target Direction: $MOT_target_dir ($EXP_motion_condition)')
                report ('Luminance Modulation: $((LUM_col_init - LUM_col_change) * 100)%')
                report ('Luminance Response Button: $LUM_button')
                report ('Motion Response Button: $MOT_button')

                // exit experiment in case of invalid input
                goto (                    
                    target                  = EXPERIMENT_EXIT
                    when                    = (EXP_correct_input == false)
                )

                // start target motion demo
                goto (                    
                    target                  = TARGET_DEMO
                    when                    = (IO_gpTriggerLeftUp == 1 && IO_gpTriggerRightUp == 1)
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state TARGET_DEMO { 

                RDP_dir                     = MOT_target_dir
                IMP_counter_demo            = 0

                // impulse sequence
                while (IMP_counter_demo < IMP_total_demo) {       // 30 impulses

                    // impulse Onset
                    live_queue_stimulus (fixationPoint)
                    live_queue_stimulus (RDP)
                    live_queue_stimulus (MASK)

                    update_stimulus_display ()

                    wait (
                        duration            = CTRL_onset_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                        duration_units      = us
                    )

                    // impulse offset
                    dequeue_stimulus (RDP)

                    update_stimulus_display ()

                    wait (
                        duration            = CTRL_offset_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                        duration_units      = us
                    )
                    
                    // update counter
                    IMP_counter_demo        += 1
                }

                direct (TRIAL_HUB)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state TRIAL_HUB {

                dequeue_stimulus (RDP)
                dequeue_stimulus (MASK)

                CTRL_progress               = '$(TRIAL_start + 1) / $TRIAL_total Trials'

                if_else {
                    // trials completed
                    if (TRIAL_number == TRIAL_total) {
                        live_queue_stimulus (exit_txt)
                    }
                    // trial break
                    else {
                        live_queue_stimulus (progress_txt)
                        live_queue_stimulus (break_txt)
                    }
                }

                live_queue_stimulus (fixationPoint)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                wait (
                    duration                = CTRL_ISI_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                    duration_units          = us
                )

                // exit experiment
                goto (                    
                    target                  = EXPERIMENT_EXIT
                    when                    = (TRIAL_number == TRIAL_total) 
                )

                // show demo again
                goto (                    
                    target                  = TARGET_DEMO
                    when                    = (TRIAL_number == 0 && IO_gpButton4 == 1)
                )

                // next trial
                goto (
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION
                    when                    = (TRIAL_number < TRIAL_total && IO_gpTriggerLeftUp == 1 && IO_gpTriggerRightUp == 1) 
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state DRIFT_CORRECTION {

                report ('-----> DRIFT CORRECTION <-----')

                // apply fixation width for drift correction
                CTRL_Fix_width_dva          = CTRL_Drift_width_dva

                // reset offset vars
                EYE_x_dva_offset            = 0
                EYE_y_dva_offset            = 0

                // alternate RDP and mask position
                RDP_pos_x                   = RDP_pos_x * -1

                // no motion
                RDP_speed                   = 0     

                wait (
                    duration                = CTRL_ISI_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                    duration_units          = us
                )

                direct (DRIFT_CORRECTION_PRE_ACQUIRE)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state DRIFT_CORRECTION_PRE_ACQUIRE {

                dequeue_stimulus (fixation_txt)
                dequeue_stimulus (progress_txt)
                dequeue_stimulus (break_txt)

                live_queue_stimulus (RDP)
                live_queue_stimulus (MASK)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                // reset eye sample parameters
                EYE_sample_x_dva            = 0
                EYE_sample_y_dva            = 0
                EYE_sample_count            = 0

                EYE_sample_x_offset         = 0
                EYE_sample_y_offset         = 0


                wait (
                    duration                = CTRL_ISI_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                    duration_units          = us
                )

                // no current fixation
                goto (                    
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION_RESET
                    when                    = (IO_fixation_flag == false)
                )

                // fixation already present
                goto (                    
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION_ACQUIRE
                    when                    = (IO_fixation_flag == true)
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state DRIFT_CORRECTION_ACQUIRE {

                // jump ahead if Eyetracking is disabled
                goto (                    
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION_ACCEPTED
                    when                    = (EXP_use_eye_tracking == false)
                )

                // lost fixation
                goto (                    
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION_RESET
                    when                    = (IO_fixation_flag == false)
                )

                // sample eye offsets
                goto (                    
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION_SAMPLE
                    when                    = (IO_fixation_flag == true && EYE_sample_count < EYE_sample_total)
                )

                // compute drift correction
                goto (                    
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION_VALIDATE
                    when                    = (IO_fixation_flag == true && EYE_sample_count == EYE_sample_total)
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state DRIFT_CORRECTION_RESET {
                
                dequeue_stimulus (RDP)
                dequeue_stimulus (MASK)

                queue_stimulus (fixation_txt)
                
                update_stimulus_display ()

                // Feedback sound
                play_sound (FixBreak_sound)

                report ('Drift Correction: Fixation Rejected!')

                wait (
                    duration                = CTRL_ISI_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                    duration_units          = us
                )

                goto (
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION_PRE_ACQUIRE
                    when                    = (IO_gpTriggerLeftUp == 1 && IO_gpTriggerRightUp == 1) 
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state DRIFT_CORRECTION_SAMPLE {

                // sample current gaze position
                EYE_sample_x_dva            += EYE_x_dva_corr
                EYE_sample_y_dva            += EYE_y_dva_corr
                EYE_sample_count            += 1

                wait (
                    duration                = Eye_sample_time_ms
                    duration_units          = ms
                )

                direct (DRIFT_CORRECTION_ACQUIRE)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state DRIFT_CORRECTION_VALIDATE {

                // compute average offset to fixation point
                EYE_sample_x_offset         = FixPoint_pos_x - (EYE_sample_x_dva/ EYE_sample_total)
                EYE_sample_y_offset         = FixPoint_pos_y - (EYE_sample_y_dva/ EYE_sample_total)

                CTRL_DriftAccept            = false

                // check offset validity
                if (CTRL_Drift_offset_min_dva < EYE_sample_x_offset && CTRL_Drift_offset_max_dva > EYE_sample_x_offset && CTRL_Drift_offset_min_dva < EYE_sample_y_offset && CTRL_Drift_offset_max_dva > EYE_sample_y_offset) {

                    CTRL_DriftAccept        = true
     
                    report ('Drift Correction: x-offset = $EYE_sample_x_offset)')
                    report ('Drift Correction: y-offset = $EYE_sample_y_offset)')                
                    
                    // Feedback sound
                    play_sound (Fixation_sound)

                    // apply offset for drift correction
                    EYE_x_dva_offset        = EYE_sample_x_offset
                    EYE_y_dva_offset        = EYE_sample_y_offset
                }

                goto (
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION_RESET
                    when                    = CTRL_DriftAccept == false
                )

                goto (
                    target                  = DRIFT_CORRECTION_ACCEPTED
                    when                    = CTRL_DriftAccept == true
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state DRIFT_CORRECTION_ACCEPTED {

                dequeue_stimulus (RDP)
                dequeue_stimulus (MASK)

                live_queue_stimulus (fixationPoint)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                report ('Drift Correction: Fixation Accepted!') 
                
                // reset fixation width to initial value 
                CTRL_Fix_width_dva          = CTRL_Fix_width_true_dva

                start_timer (
                    timer                   = ISI_Timer
                    duration                = CTRL_ISI_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                    duration_units          = us
                )

                direct (TRIAL_START)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state TRIAL_START {

                ML_sync = 1

                TRIAL_start                 += 1
                TRIAL_number                += 1

                report ('-----> TRIAL ($TRIAL_start / $TRIAL_total) <-----')
                
                // reset RDP speed
                RDP_speed                   = RDP_speed_true  

                // assign response buttons
                LUM_button                  = LUM_button
                MOT_button                  = MOT_button

                // reset counters
                LUM_target_counter          = 0
                MOT_target_counter          = 0
                IMP_counter_all             = 0
                IMP_counter_valid           = 0

                LUM_target_idx_counter      = 0
                LUM_target_idx_1            = 0
                LUM_target_idx_2            = 0
                LUM_target_idx_3            = 0
                LUM_target_idx_4            = 0
                LUM_target_idx_5            = 0
                LUM_target_idx_6            = 0

                MOT_target_idx_counter      = 0
                MOT_target_idx_1            = 0
                MOT_target_idx_2            = 0
                MOT_target_idx_3            = 0
                MOT_target_idx_4            = 0
                MOT_target_idx_5            = 0
                MOT_target_idx_6            = 0


                // preallocate target onsets
                IMP_idx                     = 0 
                IMP_remain                  = IMP_total  

                // assign number of appearing luminance changes
                LUM_target_total            = disc_rand(CTRL_targets - 1, CTRL_targets + 1)
                LUM_target_remain           = LUM_target_total

                // assign number of appearing target motion
                MOT_target_total            = disc_rand(CTRL_targets - 1, CTRL_targets + 1)
                MOT_target_remain           = MOT_target_total          
                
                // adjust spacing
                LUM_target_spacing          = 1     // no target for first impulse
                MOT_target_spacing          = 1     // no target for first impulse


                // randomize sequence of targetss
                while (IMP_idx  < IMP_total) {

                    IMP_idx                 += 1    // increase impulse index

                    // luminance change
                    if_else {
                        if (LUM_target_spacing > 0) {
                            LUM_assign_target           = false
                            LUM_force_target            = false
                        }
                        if (LUM_target_spacing <= 0 && LUM_target_remain > 0 && 
                            IMP_remain <= ((LUM_target_spacing_init + 1) * LUM_target_remain + 1)) {
                            LUM_assign_target           = true
                            LUM_force_target            = true
                        }
                        if (LUM_target_spacing <= 0 && LUM_target_remain > 0 &&
                            rand() < (LUM_target_remain / IMP_remain)) {
                            LUM_assign_target           = true
                            LUM_force_target            = false
                        }
                        else {
                            LUM_assign_target           = false
                            LUM_force_target            = false
                        }
                    }

                    // target motion
                    if_else {
                        if (MOT_target_spacing > 0) {
                            MOT_assign_target           = false
                            MOT_force_target            = false
                        }
                        if (MOT_target_spacing <= 0 && MOT_target_remain > 0 &&
                            IMP_remain <= ((MOT_target_spacing_init + 1) * MOT_target_remain + 1)) {
                            MOT_assign_target           = true
                            MOT_force_target            = true
                        }
                        if (MOT_target_spacing <= 0 && MOT_target_remain > 0 &&
                            rand() < (MOT_target_remain / IMP_remain)) {
                            MOT_assign_target           = true
                            MOT_force_target            = false
                        }
                        else {
                            MOT_assign_target           = false
                            MOT_force_target            = false
                        }
                    }

                    // prevent co-occurrence
                    if (LUM_assign_target == true && MOT_assign_target == true) {
                        if_else {
                            // mandatory luminance change
                            if (LUM_force_target == true && MOT_force_target == false) {
                                MOT_assign_target       = false
                            }
                            // mandatory target motion
                            if (LUM_force_target == false && MOT_force_target == true) {
                                LUM_assign_target       = false
                            }
                            // randomize which target
                            if (LUM_force_target == MOT_force_target && rand() < 0.5) {
                                MOT_assign_target       = false
                            }
                            else {
                                LUM_assign_target       = false
                            }
                        }
                    }

                    // store planned luminance change positions
                    if_else {
                        if (LUM_assign_target == true) {
                            LUM_target_spacing          = LUM_target_spacing_init   // increase target spacing
                            LUM_target_remain           -= 1
                            LUM_target_idx_counter      += 1

                            if_else {
                                if (LUM_target_idx_counter == 1) { 
                                    LUM_target_idx_1    = IMP_idx  
                                    }
                                if (LUM_target_idx_counter == 2) { 
                                    LUM_target_idx_2    = IMP_idx  
                                    }
                                if (LUM_target_idx_counter == 3) {
                                    LUM_target_idx_3    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                                if (LUM_target_idx_counter == 4) {
                                    LUM_target_idx_4    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                                if (LUM_target_idx_counter == 5) {
                                    LUM_target_idx_5    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                                if (LUM_target_idx_counter == 6) {
                                    LUM_target_idx_6    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                            }
                        }
                        else {
                            LUM_target_spacing          -= 1        // decrease target spacing
                        }
                    }

                    //store planned target motion positions
                    if_else {
                        if (MOT_assign_target == true) {
                            MOT_target_spacing          = MOT_target_spacing_init   // increase target spacing
                            MOT_target_remain           -= 1
                            MOT_target_idx_counter      += 1

                            if_else {
                                if (MOT_target_idx_counter == 1) {
                                    MOT_target_idx_1    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                                if (MOT_target_idx_counter == 2) {
                                    MOT_target_idx_2    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                                if (MOT_target_idx_counter == 3) {
                                    MOT_target_idx_3    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                                if (MOT_target_idx_counter == 4) {
                                    MOT_target_idx_4    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                                if (MOT_target_idx_counter == 5) {
                                    MOT_target_idx_5    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                                if (MOT_target_idx_counter == 6) {
                                    MOT_target_idx_6    = IMP_idx 
                                    }
                            }
                        }
                        else {
                            MOT_target_spacing          -= 1        // decrease target spacing
                        }
                    }

                    IMP_remain              -= 1    // decrease remaining impulse indices
                }


                if (EXP_debugging == 1) {
                    report ('Planned LUM Positions: $LUM_target_idx_1; $LUM_target_idx_2; $LUM_target_idx_3; $LUM_target_idx_4; $LUM_target_idx_5; $LUM_target_idx_6')
                    report ('Planned MOT Positions: $MOT_target_idx_1; $MOT_target_idx_2; $MOT_target_idx_3; $MOT_target_idx_4; $MOT_target_idx_5; $MOT_target_idx_6')
                }

                goto (
                    target                  = IMPULSE_ONSET
                    when                    = timer_expired(ITI_Timer)
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state IMPULSE_HUB {

                // lost fixation
                goto (
                    target                  = FIX_BREAK
                    when                    = (IO_fixationCorrected == 0 && CTRL_FixBreak_flag == false) 
                )

                // play fixation break Sound
                goto (
                    target                  = FIX_PLAY_SOUND
                    when                    = (IO_fixationCorrected == 0 && CTRL_FixBreak_flag == true && CTRL_FixSound_flag == true) 
                )

                // reset sound
                goto (
                    target                  = FIX_REPEAT_SOUND
                    when                    = (IO_fixationCorrected == 0 && CTRL_FixSound_flag == false && timer_expired(Sound_Timer) == 1) 
                )

                // restored fixation
                goto (
                    target                  = FIX_FOUND
                    when                    = (IO_fixationCorrected == 1 && CTRL_FixBreak_flag == true && CTRL_FixHold_flag == false) 
                )

                // lost fixation during recovery delay
                goto (
                    target                  = FIX_BREAK
                    when                    = (IO_fixationCorrected == 0 && CTRL_FixBreak_flag == true && CTRL_FixHold_flag == true && timer_expired(Fix_Restored_Timer) == 0) 
                )

                // reset after fixation break
                goto (
                    target                  = FIX_RESTORED
                    when                    = (IO_fixationCorrected == 1 && CTRL_FixBreak_flag == true && CTRL_FixHold_flag == true && timer_expired(Fix_Restored_Timer) == 1) 
                )

                // show next impulse
                goto (
                    target                  = IMPULSE_ONSET
                    when                    = (timer_expired(Motion_Offset_Timer) == 1 && IMP_counter_valid < IMP_total && IMP_onset == false)
                )

                // show blank screen after each impulse
                goto (
                    target                  = IMPULSE_OFFSET
                    when                    = (timer_expired(Motion_Onset_Timer) == 1 && IMP_counter_valid < IMP_total && IMP_onset == true)
                )

                // wait after last impulse
                goto (
                    target                  = IMPULSE_WAIT
                    when                    = (timer_expired(Motion_Offset_Timer) == 1 && IMP_counter_valid == IMP_total && IMP_onset == false) 
                )
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state IMPULSE_ONSET {

                // check for planned target onset
                if_else {
                    if (CTRL_FixBreak_flag == false && (
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == LUM_target_idx_1 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == LUM_target_idx_2 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == LUM_target_idx_3 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == LUM_target_idx_4 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == LUM_target_idx_5 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == LUM_target_idx_6
                        )) {
                        LUM_planned_target  = true
                    }
                    else {
                        LUM_planned_target  = false
                    }
                }

                if_else {
                    if (CTRL_FixBreak_flag == false && (
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == MOT_target_idx_1 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == MOT_target_idx_2 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == MOT_target_idx_3 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == MOT_target_idx_4 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == MOT_target_idx_5 ||
                        (IMP_counter_valid + 1) == MOT_target_idx_6
                        )) {
                        MOT_planned_target  = true
                    }
                    else {
                        MOT_planned_target  = false
                    }
                }


                // check luminance change 
                if_else {
                    // target onset
                    if (LUM_planned_target == true) {
                        LUM_target_onset    = true
                        
                        FixPoint_r          = LUM_col_change
                        FixPoint_g          = LUM_col_change
                        FixPoint_b          = LUM_col_change
                    }
                    // no target onset
                    else {
                        LUM_target_onset    = false

                        FixPoint_r          = LUM_col_init
                        FixPoint_g          = LUM_col_init
                        FixPoint_b          = LUM_col_init
                    }
                }


                // check target motion
                if_else {
                    // target onset
                    if (MOT_planned_target == true) {
                        MOT_target_onset    = true

                        RDP_dir             = MOT_target_dir  
                    }
                    // no target onset
                    else {
                        MOT_target_onset    = false 

                        if_else {
                            // every direction except target direction
                            if (CTRL_FixBreak_flag == false) { 
                                RDP_dir     = (((MOT_target_dir + disc_rand(1, IMP_dir_total-1) * IMP_dir_interval))*10 % 3600) / 10
                            }
                            // every direction except target, anti-target and subsequent directions
                            else {
                                RDP_dir     = (((MOT_target_dir + disc_rand(2, (IMP_dir_total/2)-2) * IMP_dir_interval + disc_rand(0,1) * 180))*10 % 3600) / 10
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }


                live_queue_stimulus (fixationPoint)
                live_queue_stimulus (RDP)
                live_queue_stimulus (MASK)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                IMP_onset                   = true

                start_timer (
                    timer                   = Motion_Onset_Timer
                    duration                = CTRL_onset_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                    duration_units          = us
                )

                if_else {
                    if (CTRL_FixBreak_flag == false) {
                        IMP_valid_onset     = true
                    }
                    else {
                        IMP_valid_onset     = false
                    }   
                }
                
                direct (IMPULSE_HUB)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state IMPULSE_OFFSET {

                dequeue_stimulus (RDP)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                IMP_onset                   = false

                start_timer (
                    timer                   = Motion_Offset_Timer
                    duration                = CTRL_offset_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                    duration_units          = us
                )
                
                // reset Luminance
                FixPoint_r                  = LUM_col_init
                FixPoint_g                  = LUM_col_init
                FixPoint_b                  = LUM_col_init

                // updated counter
                IMP_counter_all             += 1

                // update valid impulse counter
                if (IMP_valid_onset == true) {
                    IMP_counter_valid       += 1

                    // update luminance counter
                    if (LUM_target_onset == true) {
                        LUM_target_counter  += 1

                        if (EXP_debugging == 1) {
                            report ('Luminance Change: $LUM_target_onset ($(LUM_target_counter))')
                        }
                    }

                    // update motion counter
                    if (MOT_target_onset  == true) {
                        MOT_target_counter  += 1  

                        if (EXP_debugging == 1) { 
                            report ('Target Motion: $MOT_target_onset  ($(MOT_target_counter))')
                        }         
                    }
                }

                direct (IMPULSE_HUB)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state FIX_BREAK {

                // play feedback sound if it has not been played before
                if (CTRL_FixSound_flag == true) {
                                    
                    play_sound (FixBreak_sound)

                    start_timer (
                        timer               = Sound_Timer
                        duration            = CTRL_FixSound_ms
                        duration_units      = ms
                    )

                    CTRL_FixSound_flag      = false
                }
                
                IMP_valid_onset             = false     // indicate invalid Impulse
                CTRL_FixBreak_flag          = true      // Fixbreak
                CTRL_FixHold_flag           = false

                if (EXP_debugging == 1) {
                    report ('Fixation: Wait For Recovery...')
                }

                direct (IMPULSE_HUB)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state FIX_PLAY_SOUND {

                // fixation break feedback sound
                play_sound (FixBreak_sound)

                start_timer (
                    timer                   = Sound_Timer
                    duration                = CTRL_FixSound_ms
                    duration_units          = ms
                )

                CTRL_FixSound_flag          = false

                direct (IMPULSE_HUB)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state FIX_REPEAT_SOUND {

                CTRL_FixSound_flag          = true

                direct (IMPULSE_HUB)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state FIX_FOUND {

                // stop feedback sound
                stop_sound (FixBreak_sound)

                start_timer (
                    timer                   = Fix_Restored_Timer
                    duration                = CTRL_FixHold_ms 
                    duration_units          = ms
                )

                CTRL_FixSound_flag          = true
                
                CTRL_FixHold_flag           = true
                
                if (EXP_debugging == 1) {
                    report ('Fixation: Fixation Found...')
                }

                direct (IMPULSE_HUB)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state FIX_RESTORED {
                
                CTRL_FixHold_flag           = false
                CTRL_FixBreak_flag          = false

                if (EXP_debugging == 1) {
                    report ('Fixation: Fixation Restored!')
                }

                direct (IMPULSE_HUB)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state IMPULSE_WAIT {
                
                dequeue_stimulus (RDP)
                dequeue_stimulus (MASK)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                IMP_onset                   = false
                
                wait (
                    duration                = CTRL_wait_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                    duration_units          = us
                )

                TRIAL_end                   = TRIAL_start

                ML_sync                     = 0
                
                // report trial summary
                report ('Luminance Change Count: $LUM_target_counter / $LUM_target_total (planned)')
                if (LUM_target_counter != LUM_target_total) {
                    report ('WARNING: $(LUM_target_total - LUM_target_counter) Luminance change onsets missing!!!')
                }
                report ('Target Motion Count: $MOT_target_counter / $MOT_target_total (planned)')
                if (MOT_target_counter != MOT_target_total) {
                    report ('WARNING: $(MOT_target_total - MOT_target_counter) Target Motion onsets missing!!!')
                }
                report ('Total Impulse Count: $IMP_counter_all')
                report ('Valid Impulse Count: $IMP_counter_valid')

                direct (TRIAL_HUB)
            }

            // -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
            state EXPERIMENT_EXIT {

                report ('EXPERIMENT COMPLETED!')
                report ('EXITING ...')

                wait (
                    duration                = CTRL_wait_ms*1000 - CTRL_frame_buffer_us + (next_frame_time() - now())
                    duration_units          = us
                )

                dequeue_stimulus (fixationPoint)
                dequeue_stimulus (progress_txt)
                dequeue_stimulus (exit_txt)

                update_stimulus_display ()

                // reset input
                // EXP_motion_condition        = ""
                EXP_attention_condition     = ""
                // EXP_handedness              = ""
                LUM_button                  = ""
                MOT_button                  = ""

                // stop devices
                stop_device_io (gamePad)

                if (EXP_use_eye_tracking == 1) {
                    stop_device_io (Eyelink)
                    stop_device_io (blinkCorrection)
                }

                yield ()
            }
        }
    }
}

